      "body": "The document refers to the filter data as a “set”. In computer science, [set](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Set_(abstract_data_type)) refers to a data structure that stores unordered unique values. Sets cannot contain duplicates, trying to add a duplicate is either ignored or results in an error. I don’t think this clarification is necessary.",
